<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/16/eng@/~cl_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the definition of “Minister” the following definition: ‘ “Minister” means the Minister charged with the responsibility for the registration of companies, trust companies, businesses and limited liability partnerships;’;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/16/eng@> .
